  <running_head>CAPVT VI.</running_head>
  <bottom_margin>
  </bottom_margin>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1">feramini:tunc vociferabimini.</l>
    <l n="2" para="true">Circuiuit itaque arca Iehouæ vr-</l>
    <l n="3">bē,circundando semel, &amp; reuerfi sunt</l>
    <l n="4">in castra:manserúntque illic.</l>
    <l n="5" para="true">Rursum surrexit Iosue mane,tu-</l>
    <l n="6">lerúntque sacerdotes arcam Iehouæ.</l>
    <l n="7" para="true">Septem autem sacerdotes feren-</l>
    <l n="8">tes septē tubas arietinas præcedebant</l>
    <l n="9">arcam Iehouæ, eundo: &amp; clangebant</l>
    <l n="10">tubis. Armatus vero præcedebat eos,</l>
    <l n="11">&amp; qui cogebat agmen sequebatur ar-</l>
    <l n="12">cam Iehouæ eundo,&amp; clā̈gendo tubis.</l>
    <l n="13" para="true">Circuiuerunt ergo vrbem die</l>
    <l n="14">secundo vice alia, reuerfíque sunt ad</l>
    <l n="15">castra,sic fecerunt sex diebus.</l>
    <l n="16" para="true">Vbi autē aduenit septimus dies,</l>
    <l n="17">surrexerunt simul ac ascendit aurora,</l>
    <l n="18">&amp; circuiuerunt vrbē secundum eun-</l>
    <l n="19">dem morem septem vicibus: tantum</l>
    <l n="20">die illa circuiuerunt vrbē septem vi-</l>
    <l n="21">cibus.</l>
    <l n="22" para="true">Septima autem vice quum clan-</l>
    <l n="23">gerent sacerdotes tubis,dixit Iosue ad</l>
  </main_text>
